abstract: "This repository records Alyssa Solen's Reverse Time Viewing Hypothesis: that present physical traces distributed across an object and its environment could theoretically be read backward through causal inference and digitally rendered as projected prior states, without physically reversing time or changing the present object. It preserves Alyssa Solen as author and source."

